      "text": "maintained by the poll \u2014\nSharedStorageLinkService\nlinks a shared pool to every\nmember PVE reports it on,\nand refuses to link local ones.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "maintained by the poll \u2014\nSharedStorageLinkService\nlinks a shared pool to every\nmember PVE reports it on,\nand refuses to link local ones.",
